WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:03.630
On a computer, Grok works right in your web browser,

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:05.500
so there's nothing to install.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.170
Tap 'Copy prompt and open Grok'.

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:10.500
Grok dot com opens in a new tab.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.870
Sign in, or make a free account.

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:15.640
Click the message box, press Control V,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.950
or Command V on a Mac, then press Enter.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:21.888
Your trainer says hi, and walks you through the rest.

